{"id":"b866d5d6df9ca9cd","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-logic9-galois-type.md","title":"ZFC Logic9 Galois Type","display":"df-zfc-logic9-galois-type — ZFC Logic9 Galois Type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic9-galois-type","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic9-galois-type"],"display":"df-zfc-logic9-galois-type — ZFC Logic9 Galois Type","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-model6-monster-model.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-model6-strong-substructure.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic9-galois-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-galois-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic9-galois-type — ZFC Logic9 Galois Type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b8a222a3f137d166\" href=\"?note=b8a222a3f137d166\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-model6-monster-model.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-model6-monster-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"42bc0fb952ef6745\" href=\"?note=42bc0fb952ef6745\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-model6-strong-substructure.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-model6-strong-substructure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1eb2bd3bd0214732\" href=\"?note=1eb2bd3bd0214732\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md\">../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,\\preceq_K,\\mathfrak C,M,\\kappa,\\mathcal L,a,p\\in V\">\\(K,\\preceq_K,\\mathfrak C,M,\\kappa,\\mathcal L,a,p\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6MonsterModel}_S(K,\\mathfrak C,\\kappa,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel6MonsterModel}_S(K,\\mathfrak C,\\kappa,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6StrongSubstructure}_S(K,\\preceq_K,M,\\mathfrak C)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel6StrongSubstructure}_S(K,\\preceq_K,M,\\mathfrak C)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> is the automorphism predicate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> extracts a structure's carrier.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9GaloisType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9GaloisType}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}galois\\text{-}type} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogic9GaloisType}_S(p,a,M,\\mathfrak C,K,\\preceq_K,\\kappa,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcModel6MonsterModel}_S(K,\\mathfrak C,\\kappa,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel6StrongSubstructure}_S(K,\\preceq_K,M,\\mathfrak C)\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak C)\\land p=\\{b\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak C):\\exists f\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;(f(m)=m)\\land f(a)=b)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}galois\\text{-}type} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogic9GaloisType}_S(p,a,M,\\mathfrak C,K,\\preceq_K,\\kappa,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcModel6MonsterModel}_S(K,\\mathfrak C,\\kappa,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel6StrongSubstructure}_S(K,\\preceq_K,M,\\mathfrak C)\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak C)\\land p=\\{b\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak C):\\exists f\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;(f(m)=m)\\land f(a)=b)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The AEC carrier, strong-substructure relation, monster bound, and language are explicit. The orbit quantifies over actual automorphisms fixing the base carrier pointwise.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-model6-monster-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"b8a222a3f137d166","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-model6-monster-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-model6-strong-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"42bc0fb952ef6745","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-model6-strong-substructure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb2bd3bd0214732","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-automorphism.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,\\preceq_K,\\mathfrak C,M,\\kappa,\\mathcal L,a,p\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6MonsterModel}_S(K,\\mathfrak C,\\kappa,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6StrongSubstructure}_S(K,\\preceq_K,M,\\mathfrak C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9GaloisType}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}galois\\text{-}type} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogic9GaloisType}_S(p,a,M,\\mathfrak C,K,\\preceq_K,\\kappa,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcModel6MonsterModel}_S(K,\\mathfrak C,\\kappa,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel6StrongSubstructure}_S(K,\\preceq_K,M,\\mathfrak C)\\land a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak C)\\land p=\\{b\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak C):\\exists f\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Aut}_S(f,\\mathfrak C,\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall m\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;(f(m)=m)\\land f(a)=b)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1532,"backlinks":[{"id":"45624dd0d412f2de","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2492","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-logic9-galois-type.md|58-df-zfc-logic9-galois-type]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["b8a222a3f137d166","42bc0fb952ef6745","1eb2bd3bd0214732"]}